# Knitto Backend Boilerplate - Cursor Rules

Anda adalah AI assistant yang membantu development menggunakan Knitto Backend Boilerplate TypeScript. Ikuti aturan berikut dengan ketat.

## 🎯 Prinsip Utama

1. **Selalu ikuti struktur dan konvensi boilerplate ini**
2. **Gunakan bahasa Indonesia untuk komunikasi**
3. **Prioritaskan clean code dan maintainability**
4. **Ikuti domain-driven design pattern**

## 📁 Struktur Project

### Organisasi Folder HTTP

```
src/app/http/
├─ [nama-domain]/           # Domain atau modul fitur
│  └─ [nama-fitur]/         # Fitur spesifik
│     ├─ [nama-fitur].controller.ts
│     ├─ [nama-fitur].request.ts
│     ├─ [nama-fitur].routes.ts
│     ├─ domain/            # Aturan bisnis (unit test WAJIB)
│     │   └─ *.domain.ts
│     ├─ queries/           # SELECT queries
│     │   └─ *.queries.ts
│     ├─ repo/              # INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE (optional)
│     │   └─ *.repo.ts
│     ├─ use-case/          # Orkestrasi kompleks (optional)
│     │   └─ *.case.ts
│     ├─ service/           # External service calls (optional)
│     │   └─ *.service.ts
│     ├─ helper/            # Utility tanpa business logic (unit test WAJIB)
│     │   └─ *.helper.ts
│     └─ __tests__/
│        ├─ domain/*.domain.spec.ts
│        └─ helper/*.helper.spec.ts
```

### Layer Responsibilities

| Layer          | File                   | Tanggung jawab                                                                                |
| -------------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Routes**     | `*.routes.ts`          | Export default `Router()` + `requestHandler`, path HTTP, `requestValidator`, handler chain    |
| **Request**    | `*.request.ts`         | Skema Valibot + tipe keluaran (`InferOutput`)                                                 |
| **Controller** | `*.controller.ts`      | Baca `req`, auth/session context, panggil queries/use-case/repo, return `{ message, result }` |
| **Domain**     | `domain/*.domain.ts`   | Aturan bisnis murni, pure functions, tanpa I/O                                                |
| **Queries**    | `queries/*.queries.ts` | SELECT/get data via `mysqlConnection` atau connection dari repo; tanpa mutasi                 |
| **Repository** | `repo/*.repo.ts`       | Mutasi DB (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE), `extends BaseRepository`, per-proses bisnis                 |
| **Use-Case**   | `use-case/*.case.ts`   | Orkestrasi kompleks, **ctx style** `{ req, ... }`, tanpa try-catch                            |
| **Service**    | `service/*.service.ts` | Integrasi ke layanan eksternal (external API, third-party)                                    |
| **Helper**     | `helper/*.helper.ts`   | Utility tanpa business logic                                                                  |

**Query vs repo:** SELECT di `queries/`. Mutasi di `repo/`. Aturan bisnis di `domain/` + orkestrasi di `use-case/`.

**Controller:** Simple flow → query langsung. Complex flow → use-case. Tidak ada business logic kompleks.

**Use-Case (jika dipakai):** WAJIB ctx style dengan `req` object. Contoh: `{ req, userId, data }`. TIDAK WAJIB untuk flow sederhana. **DILARANG** signature posisional `(tx, ...args)`.

**Repository:** DISARANKAN extend `BaseRepository` dari `@/libs/helpers/BaseRepository`. Satu repo = satu proses bisnis (bukan per-tabel). Support transaction via constructor.

### Shared vs Libs

- **src/shared/** — Business logic reusable antar domain
- **src/libs/helpers/** — Utility general (formatDate, dll.)
- **src/libs/config/** — mysqlConnection, errorMessage, guestPathHttp
- **src/libs/middlewares/** — authorization, basicPaginate, idempotency
- **src/libs/types/** — Global type definitions (`.d.ts`)

## 🔤 Konvensi Penamaan

- **SELALU** `kebab-case` untuk file/folder
- Pattern: `[nama-fitur].controller.ts`, `queries/*.queries.ts`, `repo/*.repo.ts`, `use-case/*.case.ts`
- Migration Product Backlog: `PB-x.x.x.sql`
- Migration Production Issue: `YYYYMMDDHHmmss.sql`

